  want hold, is-equal(merged(flag-files(), <load ./flags\n  find flag\n\nload ./early\n  find flip\n\nload ./priv\n  find other\n\nload ./mid\n  find toggle\n\nform equal\n  head a\n  head x, like a\n  head y, like a\n  case refl\n    link c, like a\n    head\n      read c\n    head\n      read c\n\nrule toggle-law\n  take g, like flag\n  like equal flag\n    head\n      toggle(g)\n    head\n      read g\n\ntask toggle-law\n  take g\n  sift g\n    case yes\n      send back\n        make refl\n          bind c, make yes\n    case no\n      send back\n        make refl\n          bind c, make no\n>), false)

